WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.937
The cost of the investigation vastly exceeded the contested expenses.

00:00:04.887 --> 00:00:10.637
Taxpayers were billed approximately 509,000 dollars in improper claims.

00:00:10.637 --> 00:00:16.337
The resulting audits and prosecutions cost over 5.7 million dollars.
